  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a pan or griddle over medium heat.",
    "2. Toast the bread slices until lightly browned.",
    "3. Slice the empanadas in half.",
    "4. Place a toasted bread slice on a flat surface.",
    "5. Add a few slices of pickle on top of the bread.",
    "6. Place an empanada half on top of the pickles.",
    "7. Drizzle jammy jam over the empanada.",
    "8. Sprinkle some fresh dill on top.",
    "9. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
